WEBVTT

NOTE
D-District Prison interior. The camera descends through dark industrial machinery into a vast cylindrical shaft where a transport capsule plunges into the depths.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Dark industrial interior. Heavy machinery, hazard-striped hydraulics, and dim orange lights.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The camera moves through dense machinery and pipes deep inside the prison.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
A vast cylindrical shaft opens up, teal-lit tiers spiraling down into darkness.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
A transport capsule descends the shaft, headlights blazing, shrinking into the abyss.
